List of Lahore Qalandars cricketers: This is a list of cricketers who have represented Lahore Qalandars in the Pakistan Super League (PSL) since the first season of the PSL in 2016.  Players are listed alphabetically using the standard naming format of their country of origin followed by the year(s) that they have been active as a Lahore player.

